									- Holdworth, Wadsley Common, Middlewood
								</h3>
							</div>
							<ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
								<li class="list-group-item">
									<b>Meet at:</b>
									Cathedral Tram stop 9.45 catch 10.03 to Hillsborough blue route tram towards Malin Bridge,
